# The boot GPU probe viewer (a diagnostic devmgr launches with intel-gpu).
# Startup endpoints, both badged Native_GPU_Probe_Protocol.Viewer_Tag by
# devmgr: "gpu-probe" to intel-gpu (the completed boot pixels only) and
# "device-manager" to devmgr (asks for Desktop's endpoint).
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.gpu-probe-viewer"
  version => "0.1.0"
  requests => [
    (service "gpu" "gpu-probe")
    (service "device-manager" "device-manager")])
